realms, each of them with different challenges and obstacles. Players must utilize both realms\u2019 mechanisms to reach their final goal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Soothing In-game Environment</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/933450/extras/01d667b65b1251c43b67af3603ed64e2.poster.avif?t=1607479126\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/933450/extras/01d667b65b1251c43b67af3603ed64e2.webm?t=1607479126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/933450/extras/01d667b65b1251c43b67af3603ed64e2.mp4?t=1607479126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>WENJIA\u2019s exquisite hand-drawn graphics bring out both the vivid colorfulness of the Matter Realm and the fantastical strangeness of the Energy Realm. The sharp contrast between the two realms offers the players a unique visual feast.<br>Working with game audio talents from Russia, WENJIA\u2019s sound team has created an immersive fantasy environment that features deep woods, eerie ruins, and raging volcanos.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Simple Gameplay</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/933450/extras/e6271a701f653e04fca178d7f78d8d58.avif?t=1607479126\" /></div><br>WENJIA\u2019s simplified gameplay makes it easy for everyone to enjoy the game. However, the challenging level design does test the players\u2019 reflexes and ability to strategize.",
